<title>POLAND: ELEKTROBUDOWA 96 NET RISES TO PLN 13.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROBUDOWA 96 NET RISES TO PLN 13.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.75 vs   0.13</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.34 vs   0.34 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.56 vs   1.27</p>
<p> Sales		   17.03 vs  16.77</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    13.80 vs   8.38</p>
